  "notes": "ETYMOLOGY:\nやり (giving) + {取|と}り (receiving) - the back-and-forth of giving and receiving\n\nALTERNATE WRITING:\nAlso written as やりとり (all hiragana) or {遣|や}り{取|と}り\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- メールのやり{取|と}り - email exchange\n- やり{取|と}りを{続|つづ}ける - to continue exchanging\n- やり{取|と}りをする - to exchange, to interact\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {交換|こうかん} - exchange (more formal)\n- {会話|かいわ} - conversation\n- {連絡|れんらく} - contact, communication",
